   "text": "What I want every parent in this community to know is that we care deeply about your lived experiences. We've learned a lot from you and we've put those learnings to work at GRIN Therapeutics to deliver a novel treatment for you and your child and to make a difference in your lives. That's what motivates us every single day and that's why we do this work.",
